<title>NETHERLANDS: AND INT PUB ACQUIRES UK MAPS FIRM.</title>
<headline>AND INT PUB ACQUIRES UK MAPS FIRM.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>AND International Publishers Plc said it had agreed to buy the British company European Map Graphics Ltd for about one million pounds sterling.</p>
</text>
